                                                                      4.2   Estimating Impacts of Great Coaches
                                                                          Our model from 4.1 gave us many valuable insights that can be used not only to find potential instances of the




                                                                                                                                       ：
                                                                      great coach effect but also to estimate the impacts of these great coaches. For each of the top 20 country-sport




